.TH ARIF_RL_ENABLE 3 "Aug 03, 2025" 0.2.0 "ARIF User Manual"
.
.SH NAME
arif_rl_enable - setup Readline for ARIF
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.EX
.B #include <arif_rl.h>
.PP
.B void
.B arif_rl_enable (
.BI "    rl_completion_func_t *" complete_func ,
.BI "    rl_compdisp_func_t   *" display_func ,
.BI "    char const           *" word_break_chars
.B );
.EE
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR arif_rl_enable ()
function enables using Readline as an ARIF frontend.
If already enabled, function behavior is undefined.
.PP
The function updates several Readline completion variables.
Some of them shall be provided by the caller:
.PP
.TS
l l
---
lI lI.
Readline Completion Variable	Replacement
rl_attempted_completion_function	complete_func
rl_completion_display_matches_hook	display_func
rl_completer_word_break_characters	word_break_chars
.TE
.PP
The
.I complete_func
and
.I display_func
functions shall be implemented using
.BR arif_rl_complete (3)
and
.BR arif_rl_display (3),
accordingly.
.PP
Original values of the Readline completion variables are saved before updated,
so that they could be restored later by calling
.BR arif_rl_disable (3).
.
